            "review_title": "Review at CocoMon Brewery",
            "review_text": "Cara-jane H\n22 contributions\n1\nBest place to eat and drink in Vietnam!\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nWow! What a fabulous place! The rooftop garden is magical, the ambience and lighting was perfect. We had fried rice with goose and BBQ prawns with a heavenly chilli dip and a salad of tomatoes, gherkins and olives all presented on beautiful wooden blocks. I had 0.5l dragonfruit and ginger kombucha, my partner had a beer, £9, best meal yet! The family were charming, the woman even sprayed us with mosquito repellent and gave us leaves from her garden to rub on our bites! Couldn't recommend this place highly enough. If you're in Nha Trang, check them out!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 2, 2020\nJulia Chu\nDear Cara-jane H,\n\nThank you for choosing CocoMon Brewery and we're delighted to hear that you enjoyed the experience at our place. We appreciate your kind feedback and look forward to seeing you again. Thank you.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nCocoMon Brewery Team.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
