            "review_text": "Julia\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n1\nStunning rooftop with craft beer\nFeb 2020 • Family\nThe atmosphere of the rooftop is charming. Warm and welcoming surroundings. There are many choices of food. The portions are big and the price was reasonable. Highly recommend dark beer, smoking shelf buffalo, goose meat (I love this one) and spaghetti carbonara.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 22, 2020",
