            "review_title": "Review at CocoMon Brewery",
            "review_text": "Steter\nCity of San Marino, San Marino80 contributions\n1\nLovely terrace, craft beers and good food\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nWe went a couple of time and always had good time. \nThe staff is kind, beers are good and food too.\nDefinitely recommended and will be back.\nWritten February 12, 2020\nJulia Chu\nDear stet047,\n\nThank you for choosing CocoMon Brewery as a venue for your dinner. We're really glad to hear overall you enjoyed the experience here with us. We look forward to seeing you again soon.\n\nBest regards,\n\nCocoMon Brewery Team.\nRead more\nWritten May 11, 2020\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
